OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after landslide from coast
OL,4,Apath to beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been warned to stay away
OL,7,Ffrom a section of the South West Coast
OL,8,Fpath and the beach below on Dorset's
OL,9,FJurassic Coast after a landslide.
OL,11,FA large chunk of cliff above Chapman's
OL,12,FPool near Swanage has collapsed near
OL,13,Fthe Royal Marines memorial.
OL,15,FDorset Council said: "We're asking
OL,16,Fpeople to stay away from the area
OL,17,Fbecause there may be more material to
OL,18,Ffall and that which is on the beach
OL,19,Fwill still be unstable."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
